Man, them niggas gone, man.
He smoked both them fools.


00:24:44.096 --> 00:24:46.496
- One dude?
- Yeah.


00:24:46.665 --> 00:24:48.860
One dude smoked
two of my motherfuckers?


00:24:49.034 --> 00:24:51.730
What are y'all, bitches?
Do I have to buy y'all dresses?


00:24:51.904 --> 00:24:54.429
You niggas want miniskirts, tutus?


00:24:54.606 --> 00:24:58.269
Dip your motherfucking ass in olive oil
and put you in roller skates, bitch?


00:24:58.443 --> 00:25:01.879
Dude said his name
was like, Ballister...


00:25:02.047 --> 00:25:05.244
...or Bollister or some shit...
- Ballister did this to you?


00:25:05.417 --> 00:25:07.681
Yeah, that's that nigga, right.
Yeah, Ballister.


00:25:07.853 --> 00:25:09.684
Fuck. The guy
I was telling you about.


00:25:10.122 --> 00:25:12.647
You knew this motherfucker
was gonna do shit like this?


00:25:12.825 --> 00:25:15.794
I got a lot of money
on this deal, partner.


00:25:15.961 --> 00:25:18.828
Ain't got time for this bullshit.


00:25:18.997 --> 00:25:22.364
- Clean that motherfucker up.
- Come on, man.


00:25:25.470 --> 00:25:27.461
Yeah, I can see
what you're thinking, Benny.


00:25:27.639 --> 00:25:29.436
You had deceit on your mind.


00:25:29.608 --> 00:25:32.668
Think you're gonna take
a brother down?


00:25:33.779 --> 00:25:35.246
Remember <i>Scarface,</i>
motherfucker?


00:25:35.414 --> 00:25:39.544
"Look at you now.
Look at you now, you fuck."


00:25:41.653 --> 00:25:43.985
So it must feel good
to be able to put to use...


00:25:44.156 --> 00:25:46.249
...those lessons
you learned in the military.


00:25:46.425 --> 00:25:49.258
Yeah, well, I really wasn't
in the military.


00:25:49.561 --> 00:25:51.051
You're not a salesman, Simon.


00:25:51.230 --> 00:25:54.529
And you're not a cop. And someone
