00:25:54.700 --> 00:25:58.534
No, no, no. All the fighting stuff,
I got that off home videos.


00:25:59.571 --> 00:26:01.368
Whatever.


00:26:01.540 --> 00:26:04.236
- Listen, could I ask you a question?
- Shoot.


00:26:04.409 --> 00:26:07.344
Those bangers that were here,
what gang are they with?


00:26:07.880 --> 00:26:10.610
Hyde Park.
They're Chivo's boys.


00:26:10.782 --> 00:26:13.080
Chivo had something to do
with your son's murder?


00:26:13.352 --> 00:26:14.751
I'll let you know.


00:26:17.389 --> 00:26:20.881
- <i>Hello.</i>
- Hello, this is Simon.


00:26:21.727 --> 00:26:23.888
Simon? Yeah...


00:26:24.062 --> 00:26:28.499
Yeah, Max spoke very fondly
about you.


00:26:29.368 --> 00:26:30.960
I saw you at the funeral.


00:26:31.904 --> 00:26:35.465
I wanted to come over
and pay my condolences...


00:26:35.641 --> 00:26:38.542
...but I just wasn't quite
in the mood, sorry.


00:26:39.478 --> 00:26:40.911
I understand.


00:26:41.079 --> 00:26:43.877
I wanted to see if the police
had been by to interview you...


00:26:44.049 --> 00:26:48.110
