on a computer, by any chance?


00:27:00.065 --> 00:27:02.465
Yeah, but the police took it.


00:27:03.802 --> 00:27:06.999
Well, listen,
I just want you to know one thing.


00:27:07.172 --> 00:27:08.833
I will find who did this to my son.


00:27:09.007 --> 00:27:13.103
And if you need anything,
you call me, you hear?


00:27:13.679 --> 00:27:15.772
All right, babe.


00:27:16.682 --> 00:27:17.842
Shoot it.


00:27:18.016 --> 00:27:19.142
Defense.


00:27:19.318 --> 00:27:22.048
Come on, man,
Don't let them score again.


00:27:23.588 --> 00:27:25.021
Man.


00:27:25.190 --> 00:27:27.590
Pass the ball, man.


00:27:27.759 --> 00:27:31.024
Make some shots, I could dish it
to you. You playing with no D on it.


00:27:31.363 --> 00:27:35.163
They done got three points, man.
It's 9-7. You wanna win this or what?


00:27:35.334 --> 00:27:36.426
You crazy?


00:27:36.601 --> 00:27:37.863
We need to talk.


00:27:42.908 --> 00:27:46.207
Look around you, fool.
You see all those eyes on us?


00:27:47.346 --> 00:27:50.110
Any of them see me get in that car,
I'm dead. You feel me?


00:27:50.382 --> 00:27:55.012
Well, look, I'll just pretend like
I'm a policeman. You know?


00:27:55.187 --> 00:27:57.087
You ain't no cop,
that's for sure, man.


00:27:57.255 --> 00:27:59.655
Heard what happened
to them boys.


00:27:59.825 --> 00:28:02.817
News in the 'hood travels fast,
don't it, now?


00:28:02.995 --> 00:28:04.656
Look, man, I need your help.


00:28:05.063 --> 00:28:07.657
- What's up, partner?
- It's good, homes.


00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:09.389
What kind of help?


00:28:09.568 --> 00:28:11.900
I need you to help me find
who killed my son.


00:28:12.871 --> 00:28:16.568
Ain't no way nobody ever gonna find
his killer, man, that's for damn sure.


00:28:16.975 --> 00:28:18.704
You have to tell me what you know.


00:28:23.382 --> 00:28:25.577
What you gonna do
if you find the shooter, huh?


00:28:26.084 --> 00:28:27.847
I'm gonna kill him.


00:28:30.956 --> 00:28:33.754
I don't care who ordered the hit.


00:28:34.893 --> 00:28:37.794
I don't care
whose business is what.


00:28:37.963 --> 00:28:40.591
I just wanna know
who killed my son.


00:28:48.907 --> 00:28:50.898
It's not looking good for me, man.


00:28:51.076 --> 00:28:52.236
Get in the car.


00:29:09.728 --> 00:29:11.525
All right, showtime.
What do you know?


00:29:13.932 --> 00:29:17.800
Man, look, man, there's this Mexican
called El Chivo, all right?


00:29:17.969 --> 00:29:19.664
- The goat?
- Yeah.


00:29:19.838 --> 00:29:22.500
He runs the Hyde Park Gang.


00:29:22.974 --> 00:29:24.737
Them motherfuckers there.


00:29:24.910 --> 00:29:27.674
You think this guy
might have pulled the trigger?


00:29:29.281 --> 00:29:31.078
Maybe.


00:29:31.249 --> 00:29:34.082
I mean, maybe he had
somebody pull a drive-by.


00:29:34.252 --> 00:29:39.952
Well, like I said, I don't really care
about who ordered it or anything.


00:29:40.125 --> 00:29:41.319
I just want the shooter.


00:29:42.060 --> 00:29:44.585
Well, if it came from Chivo,
he would know who did it.


00:29:44.963 --> 00:29:47.727
You have any idea
why he might want my son dead?


00:29:49.434 --> 00:29:54.565
Max, man... Look, he hit
them bookie joints hard, man.


00:29:54.739 --> 00:29:57.572
Chivo, he runs most of them.
You know how it is, man.


00:29:57.742 --> 00:30:00.643
You start fucking with a man's money,
you could end up dead.


00:30:02.914 --> 00:30:04.745
