00:30:05.584 --> 00:30:10.487
He got a club on Slauson
called Anodyne, all right?


00:30:10.655 --> 00:30:12.452
He's there most nights.


00:30:13.558 --> 00:30:15.753
All right, you did good, man.


00:30:15.927 --> 00:30:18.293
I'll see you soon, you hear?
Thank you.


00:30:18.463 --> 00:30:21.694
Yeah, man. Right.


00:30:23.602 --> 00:30:24.694
Hey, Gary.


00:30:25.871 --> 00:30:26.963
This yours?


00:30:30.275 --> 00:30:33.369
