if you could let me in.


00:32:35.900 --> 00:32:36.889
How's that?


00:32:37.068 --> 00:32:38.933
- I'll tell you what, tough guy.
- What?


00:32:39.104 --> 00:32:41.800
If you can make it back down,
you and me, we've got a date.


00:32:41.973 --> 00:32:44.237
- All right.
- Why don't you go on in?


00:32:57.689 --> 00:32:59.122
Hey, man, private club.


00:33:11.836 --> 00:33:14.168
