- Hey, hey.


00:33:24.716 --> 00:33:28.174
I'm Simon Ballister, Max's father.


00:33:29.321 --> 00:33:31.346
Sorry to hear about your son.


00:33:33.458 --> 00:33:35.790
I wanted to talk to you
for a minute, if I could.


00:33:36.995 --> 00:33:39.463
Girls, I have to say,
I've found something...


00:33:39.631 --> 00:33:41.428
