00:33:51.142 --> 00:33:53.610
Well, I've been trying
to get some answers, you know?


00:33:53.778 --> 00:33:57.214
Yeah. Kind of becoming a habit
with you, ain't it?


00:33:57.382 --> 00:33:59.373
I hope not.


00:34:04.456 --> 00:34:08.017
Some folks say you might know
something about who killed my son.


00:34:08.193 --> 00:34:09.751
Now, let me take a guess.


00:34:09.928 --> 00:34:12.726
You heard that from some
myopic gangbangers, right?


00:34:12.997 --> 00:34:14.021
That's right.


00:34:15.066 --> 00:34:16.931
