00:35:30.108 --> 00:35:33.908
You know, I look at you...


00:35:34.078 --> 00:35:36.911
...I see a man like me.


00:35:37.715 --> 00:35:41.742
A bad man with good intentions.


00:35:41.920 --> 00:35:43.353
I believe you.


00:35:45.123 --> 00:35:48.456
<i>Mami,</i> tequila.


00:35:54.532 --> 00:35:56.591
- Anything else?
- Later.


00:36:08.313 --> 00:36:11.544
Here's to my son, and finding
the motherfucker who killed him.


00:36:15.053 --> 00:36:16.953
Tough guy.


00:36:17.655 --> 00:36:18.713
