must have been really close.


00:37:15.947 --> 00:37:20.350
You know, when time passes on,
you kind of get to thinking a little bit.


00:37:21.085 --> 00:37:26.717
Seems like
every day that goes by...


00:37:27.592 --> 00:37:31.084
...you kind of can't get used
to the fact...


00:37:31.262 --> 00:37:34.322
...that somebody
that close to you is gone.


00:37:34.499 --> 00:37:38.299
