has actually happened.


00:37:46.611 --> 00:37:49.876
Aim. Fire.


00:38:06.965 --> 00:38:11.061
<i>There's really</i>
<i>no greater sorrow...</i>


00:38:11.235 --> 00:38:16.195
<i>... than when a man's own child</i>
<i>passes before he does.</i>


00:38:19.944 --> 00:38:22.674
