you know?


00:39:09.527 --> 00:39:11.654
That close.


00:39:21.739 --> 00:39:23.172
That's him right there, yo.


00:39:23.341 --> 00:39:26.310
Why the fuck does Armand
want this nigga dead anyway?


00:39:26.477 --> 00:39:29.708
